{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/654d7b42bba5a41c7bcb792abe4b7476.poster.avif?t=1765464952\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/654d7b42bba5a41c7bcb792abe4b7476.webm?t=1765464952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/654d7b42bba5a41c7bcb792abe4b7476.mp4?t=1765464952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Seafrog </strong>is an action-platformer mashed with the movement of lite-skateboarding. Grind, kick-flip and find the flow with a rocket-powered wrench that moves smoother than a buttered beluga!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A SEA-SLICK PLATFORMER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >String together combos by using a simple auto-trick system, landing grinds on enemies and rusty pipes to fuel up your rocket-wrench! Use the fuel to boost through enemies, fly straight up walls, and stick to ceilings in order to complete over 100 handcrafted challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/b6a34a8aa5e4ea5c6e1068bf722d9268.poster.avif?t=1765464952\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/b6a34a8aa5e4ea5c6e1068bf722d9268.webm?t=1765464952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/b6a34a8aa5e4ea5c6e1068bf722d9268.mp4?t=1765464952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE RUN DOWN SHIPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each chapter in Seafrog is based on a ships theme. Battle vengeful Viking ghosts aboard the Sea Dragon. Dig in for an unsavory meal aboard the Chunky Chacken, where you\u2019ll discover a man-eating chicken outbreak. Finally, get ready for some monkey business at The Sweater Factory, an abandoned workshop run by an unexpected crew of apes causing all the ruckus. Each chapter holds a Master Gear, guarded by an ultimate boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/9eea9047a6ba350393015254a60ca892.poster.avif?t=1765464952\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/9eea9047a6ba350393015254a60ca892.webm?t=1765464952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/9eea9047a6ba350393015254a60ca892.mp4?t=1765464952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER GEAR, HO!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle the legendary Skraken, Metal Beak the Momma Chacken, and... Gerald. Face these colorful 'n crusty foes to retrieve the Master Gears and repair your cannon. Blast yourself to a stranded seaplane to escape the <i>seahole</i>, a mysterious sinking hole in the ocean\u2026 before ye end up in Davy Jones' Locker!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/cbfe04ff45292588af7b1d0d6122ba7d.poster.avif?t=1765464952\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/cbfe04ff45292588af7b1d0d6122ba7d.webm?t=1765464952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/cbfe04ff45292588af7b1d0d6122ba7d.mp4?t=1765464952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES LIST</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10-14 hours of story campaign featuring three boss encounters to test your moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with a  colorful cast of characters suitable for all ages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and Combine 24 Mod Chips to customize your play, adjust them for a more relaxed experience or crank up your stats for more speed and challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scour every room to uncover over 120 hidden Snakestones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16+ hours to 100% item collection in every map location.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller or mouse and keyboard support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimized for the Steam Deck.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Combo-machine x20","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2107540/26369ef3783552bb4d738da5841ac8aad53317a8.jpg"},{"name":"Combo-machine x50","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2107540/a8fd1f6495aa090f1e69f783ae954b567470cab2.jpg"},{"name":"Combo-machine x100","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2107540/3e4040883856fda886db9fe6c877d2e9bd6d19de.jpg"},{"name":"Fast Frog","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2107540/80020db706604acb67cdd5b9dac64b4ea4abbbec.jpg"},{"name":"Under 3:00 Min","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2107540/0b4c7c0fbb8c4b23942e10e75c1f75b49e0dd36f.jpg"},{"name":"Hot Doggin' 10k","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2107540/c4c43b5a077825d63e8850c590e5802ffe41a113.jpg"},{"name":"Hot Doggin' 50k","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2107540/93677f352f197639eb282a57f86d6bd65a939132.jpg"},{"name":"Hot Doggin' 100k","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2107540/268db7d1365b4515fe78b5e41fd87ab42db60d61.jpg"},{"name":"Into the Sunset","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2107540/b2b0eb7324421ce0606cb210a95b5713b4b6968b.jpg"},{"name":"Master Modder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2107540/9ea8641f5753de1331fb4cfce1627f5eb204e09b.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2107540?t=1765464952","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765464952","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/363561cbfebe412c1993966b30db5d55c4bd1711/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765464952","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/363561cbfebe412c1993966b30db5d55c4bd1711/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765464952","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/654d7b42bba5a41c7bcb792abe4b7476.poster.avif?t=1765464952\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/654d7b42bba5a41c