class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/9eea9047a6ba350393015254a60ca892.poster.avif?t=1765464952\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/9eea9047a6ba350393015254a60ca892.webm?t=1765464952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/9eea9047a6ba350393015254a60ca892.mp4?t=1765464952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MASTER GEAR, HO!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle the legendary Skraken, Metal Beak the Momma Chacken, and... Gerald. Face these colorful 'n crusty foes to retrieve the Master Gears and repair your cannon. Blast yourself to a stranded seaplane to escape the <i>seahole</i>, a mysterious sinking hole in the ocean\u2026 before ye end up in Davy Jones' Locker!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/cbfe04ff45292588af7b1d0d6122ba7d.poster.avif?t=1765464952\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/cbfe04ff45292588af7b1d0d6122ba7d.webm?t=1765464952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/extras/cbfe04ff45292588af7b1d0d6122ba7d.mp4?t=1765464952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES LIST</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10-14 hours of story campaign featuring three boss encounters to test your moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interact with a  colorful cast of characters suitable for all ages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect and Combine 24 Mod Chips to customize your play, adjust them for a more relaxed experience or crank up your stats for more speed and challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scour every room to uncover over 120 hidden Snakestones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16+ hours to 100% item collection in every map location.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller or mouse and keyboard support.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimized for the Steam Deck.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["OhMyMe Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2107540/bb75c27735dfcb3acf50d98ee76c0960cdc912b6/header.jpg?t=1765464952","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Copyright 2025 Oh My Me Games, LLC. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2107540/732489642/a7594ef6dc24e3649fcf322290aa68369281cbe4/1764833755/dash_av1.mpd?t=1764881663","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2107540/732489642/a7594ef6dc24e3649fcf322290aa68369281cbe4/1764833755/dash_h264.mpd?t=1764881663","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2107540/732489642/a7594ef6dc24e3649fcf322290aa68369281cbe4/1764833755/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1764881663","id":257126445,"name":"Official Release Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257126445/cb8d817db8bb468ca0f4a02f4b938a23197c90e9/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1764881663"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2107540/2081821692/c00782a480e683a10d3011d34e61df184ea658ba/1765409733/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765415478","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/210